        add_monoid_hom_kernel_quotient_project(f, b))
}

theorem add_monoid_hom_kernel_quotient_project_add_right_of_kernel_relation[A: AddMonoid, B: AddMonoid](
    f: AddMonoidHom[A, B], a: A, b1: A, b2: A
